[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mMissing knowledge → materialized once → answered deterministically.\u001b[0m          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m 0 → 7 failure modes, every node tagged \u001b[1msource:LLM-derived\u001b[0m so it stays        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m auditable and distinct from data-derived facts. Repeat asks hit the graph    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m (semantic cache).                                                            \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
